
Installation of Active Directory:
 1.server manager
 2.manage
 3.add roles and features
 4.check roles based and feature based installation
 5.select host
 6.select ADDS
 7.add feature
 8.next and install


Configure Active Directory
 1.server manager
 2.clcik adds
 3.click 'more' at the top of section
 4.click 'promote this server to domain' link
 5.check 'add new forest' and add any domain name and next
 6. select forest functional level and domain functional level 
    set password for ds restore mode and next and next
